name: wordforge
version: '0.6.0-preview'
summary: Native page-based writing for Linux
description: |
  Wordforge is a native C++ and Qt word processor with a minimal menu,
  toolbar and format panel, command palette,
  multilingual text shaping, paragraph styles, lists, PDF export and recovery
  snapshots. This developer preview opens Wordforge (.wfg) and UTF-8 text
  documents and imports supported text/formatting from DOCX into editable copies.
  DOCX export is supported; complex Word features are not preserved.
base: core24
grade: devel
confinement: strict
license: Apache-2.0
architectures: [@ARCH@]
apps:
  wordforge:
    command: bin/wordforge-launch
    plugs: [desktop, desktop-legacy, x11, wayland, home, removable-media, opengl, cups]
